description: A large body of work broken into sub-issues
labels: [epic]
title: "[Epic] "
body:
  - type: textarea
    id: outcome
    attributes:
      label: Outcome
      description: What does done look like for the whole epic?
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: >
        After creating this issue, add child issues with **Create sub-issue**
        (or `gh issue create` and link them). Progress rolls up automatically.
  - type: textarea
    id: out-of-scope
    attributes:
      label: Out of scope

